    "semanticLookGainRecommended": 1,
    "normalSizeEvidence": "Actual192CSS stage, density1; visible standing bird about118world wide. The136x89 codec crop is drawn at shared full-stage origin22,73, preserving scale and root; no enlargement/fit. All3 clips were inspected live on light/dark, neutral60\u2192pose18\u2192neutral12 at30Hz. Own observations verify phase60\u201377, exact return78 and terminal89 through3000ms, with no page errors. Neck-bend is a true source head/neck pose change, not translated bobbing; it demonstrates attention, not a supported drinking routine.",
    "technicalSeparation": "Frozen shared pixel receipts PASS for all3 pairs; actual canonical JSON passes241205/230787/230693bytes respectively. These source technical results do not override the two held appearance verdicts or establish physical feet, water geometry, full schema, pins or current Mac admission.",
    "recommendation": "Retain neck-bend as a provisional source look candidate for bounded later intake; keep native-look/recovery held. Runtime NOT_TESTED. No current app binding, live acceptance, new drawing or full drinking/action completion is claimed."
  },
